# PET tape-loading smoke test - real Commodore Datasette tape (see
# roms/pet/test-tapes/README.md for provenance), driven through PetDebuggerSession the same way
# personal-003's Retro.Debugger .dbg scripts drive a tape-attach + boot check.
profile pet-2001-32
roms roms/pet
devices
tape roms/pet/test-tapes/tower-and-dragon-town.tap
devices
trace 50
status
